  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/SanAnton14toga19.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p>Toga ha celebrado este s&aacute;bado, 18 de enero,&nbsp;la tradicional fiesta de San Ant&oacute;n, con la tradicional bendici&oacute;n y reparto de rollos, as&iacute; como la hoguera en la plaza del Toro. Tambi&eacute;n ha habido comida de olla a mediod&iacute;a y discom&oacute;vil a medianoche. El domingo se ha celebrado la misa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga11.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga12.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga13.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga14.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga16.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga16\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga17.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga17\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga18.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga18\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14/sananton14toga19.jpg\" alt=\"sananton14toga19\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantontoga14